      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "se": "0418",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……っ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃？\r\n寒いのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "は、はいっ……少しだけ……\r\n汗をかいたからでしょうか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "風邪でも引いたら大変だ──俺の上着で悪いけど……\r\nほら、これでも羽織れば少しはマシになると思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "い、いえ……っ\r\nそれじゃあ、プロデューサーさんが寒くなっちゃいますっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は汗もかいてないし、全然平気だ\r\nそれより、真乃が体調を崩してしまう方が心配だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……あ、ありがとうございます\r\nそれじゃあ、少しだけお借りしますね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110060"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "se": "0328",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……ほわぁ\r\nあたたかいです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、良かった\r\n最近、ちょっと肌寒くなってきたよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい\r\nすっかり秋らしくなって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110080"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0640",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あ……ふふっ、モズさんも鳴いていますっ\r\n小さい秋、見つけちゃいましたっ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へぇ、今のが『モズの高鳴き』ってやつか\r\n確か、秋の風物詩だったよなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "意識してなかったら聞き逃してたよ\r\n教えてくれてありがとう、真乃",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そ、そんなっ\r\nお礼を言われるようなことじゃ……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もう何度も秋を見てきてるけど\r\n真乃がいてくれたから、新しい秋を見つけられたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……私も、アイドルになってから\r\n色んな秋を見つけられるようになった気がするんです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ。『食欲の秋』に『スポーツの秋』に\r\n『芸術の秋』……あっ、あと『行楽の秋』もですっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、真乃にとって\r\nたくさん実りがあったようで良かったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "これも、灯織ちゃんやめぐるちゃん\r\n事務所のみんな……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110150,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そして、一番最初に背中を押してくれた\r\nプロデューサーさんのおかげです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "改めまして、本当にありがとうございますっ",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺は背中を押しただけだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "いえ……っ\r\nだけ、じゃないです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110180,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "それがなかったら、\r\n私はずっと踏み出せないままでしたから",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110190,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "──私はこれからも、たくさんの実りをつけていきたいです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110200,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……でも、もしかしたら、この先……\r\n足を止めてしまうことがあるかもしれません……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110210,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\nそのときは、また……背中を押してほしいです……っ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろん\r\nどんなときでも、全力で真乃を支えるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001009110220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ありがとうございますっ\r\n……ふふ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200100911/2001009110220"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
